#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-radio-input-group` — A single-select radio `<fieldset>`, plain or as a connected segmented toggle."
msgstr "`.instui-radio-input-group` — Tek seçimli radyo `<fieldset>`, düz veya bağlı segmentlenmiş bir açma/kapama olarak."

#: css/radio-input-group.md
